                                "sense_id": "b99c3d15-15af-3b22-8e3c-9669896dec13",
                                "text": "We useter watch the steamers an' the hathis pilin' teak. Elephints a-pilin' teak"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c11f567f-31f1-4420-94a5-114be9b313a3",
                                "sense_id": "b99c3d15-15af-3b22-8e3c-9669896dec13",
                                "text": "the Hathi is a wily animal , and will face fire and steel rather than what he suspects to be a trap"
                            },
                            {
