                                "sense_id": "b99c3d15-15af-3b22-8e3c-9669896dec13",
                                "text": "Here were we, jampacked on a narrow track down which the hathi was certain to come if he came at all , not a fire - iron of any sort among the lot of us, to all appearances not a vestige of an escape on either side"
